      "message": "What happens if the type is `void` but I\u0027ve also attached `attr` or binding point? Can that happen?",
      "revId": "2aed303d2e1a34dcd0bbc30b035b6e112500a512",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
